<title>UK: LucasVarity amid talk of restructuring.</title>
<headline>LucasVarity amid talk of restructuring.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in British-based automotive components group LucasVarity Plc gained on Friday amid talk that a statement about restructuring is expected during next week, dealers and analysts said.</p>
<p>The shares rose 7p to 253-1/2p by 1222 GMT in volume of 2.2 million shares.</p>
<p>The company was not intially available to confirm that any form of statement was planned.</p>
<p>--Andrew Langlands, London Newsroom +44 171 542 7717</p>
